Careful, Luffy!

254
00:20:57,767 --> 00:21:00,767
That machine's no match for the spirit of the squid!

255
00:21:03,767 --> 00:21:04,767
Spirit!

256
00:21:08,767 --> 00:21:09,767
That's not spirit!

257
00:21:10,767 --> 00:21:12,767
That's just spit!

258
00:21:17,767 --> 00:21:18,767
Ink!

259
00:21:20,767 --> 00:21:25,767
Fortunately, I can copy myself with squidding!

260
00:21:27,767 --> 00:21:29,767
The spirit of the squid is unstuffed!

261
00:21:30,767 --> 00:21:31,767
Fireball!

262
00:21:32,767 --> 00:21:34,767
No, I don't want to be dried squid!

263
00:21:35,767 --> 00:21:36,767
Wow!

264
00:21:36,767 --> 00:21:38,767
I didn't know your robot could shoot fireballs!

265
00:21:38,767 --> 00:21:40,767
How many cool attacks can this baby do?

266
00:21:44,767 --> 00:21:45,767
Wait! That came out of you?

267
00:21:45,767 --> 00:21:48,767
You really shouldn't have let your guard down, little guy!

268
00:21:48,767 --> 00:21:49,767
Yeah, like I would!

269
00:21:49,767 --> 00:21:50,767
Wait for it!

270
00:21:50,767 --> 00:21:51,767
Three shot!

271
00:21:52,767 --> 00:21:53,767
Heavy gun!

272
00:21:56,767 --> 00:21:59,767
Who uses their bare hand to stop a hammer?

273
00:22:00,767 --> 00:22:08,767
On second thought, I probably could have found a less painful way to do that!

274
00:22:08,767 --> 00:22:09,767
Hey, Chopper!

275
00:22:09,767 --> 00:22:12,767
I thought that one was supposed to be your normal looking form!

276
00:22:12,767 --> 00:22:14,767
Sure you're okay looking so freaky?

277
00:22:14,767 --> 00:22:15,767
Haha!

278
00:22:15,767 --> 00:22:16,767
I don't care anymore!

279
00:22:16,767 --> 00:22:20,767
I wanted to look human before, because I didn't have any friends!

280
00:22:21,767 --> 00:22:24,767
But now, I want to be a monster so I can help Luffy!

281
00:22:24,767 --> 00:22:25,767
Gotcha!

282
00:22:25,767 --> 00:22:28,767
I'll slice that smile right off your face!

283
00:22:36,767 --> 00:22:40,767
Bring me the real strongest swordsman on Fishman Island!

284
00:22:43,767 --> 00:22:44,767
There's no way it's you!

285
00:22:44,767 --> 00:22:46,767
I didn't even break a sweat!

286
00:22:46,767 --> 00:22:47,767
Got you now!

287
00:22:50,767 --> 00:22:51,767
Sorry!

288
00:22:51,767 --> 00:22:52,767
But your time is up!

289
00:22:55,767 --> 00:22:57,767
Did you hear a word that I said?

290
00:22:58,767 --> 00:22:59,767
I'm gonna save them all!

291
00:22:59,767 --> 00:23:02,767
From you and anything you've got!

292
00:23:02,767 --> 00:23:12,767
The battle against the new Fishman Pirates races towards its climax in Concord Plaza.

293
00:23:13,767 --> 00:23:17,767
Meanwhile, in the open sea, Hordy mercilessly pummels Luffy in a fit of rage.

294
00:23:18,767 --> 00:23:23,767
However, Luffy is determined to keep his promise to Fukuboshi and unleashes his most deadly attack

295
00:23:23,767 --> 00:23:26,767
in hopes of finishing the battle before it's too late.

296
00:23:27,767 --> 00:23:31,767
On the next One Piece, Luffy's all-out attack, Red Hawk Blast!

297
00:23:31,767 --> 00:23:33,767
I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!

